1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:08,675
Posting every day without a plan is like driving fast without a destination: lots of fuel, no arrival.

2
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:21,305
Set a SMART goal: specific, measurable, achievable, relevant and time-bound. Sixty new paying customers a month by March, not grow on social media.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,800
Spend most on what works, some on promising tests, and a little on bold experiments. Review every week.

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:39,925
Days one to thirty: fix the foundations: your Google profile, website basics, tracking, and a sign-up offer.

5
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:48,480
Days thirty-one to sixty: test small ads, start email or WhatsApp journeys, and collect reviews.

6
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:56,670
Days sixty-one to ninety: double down on the winners, cut the losers, and write down what you learned.

7
00:00:58,380 --> 00:01:10,155
Certificates from Google, Meta and HubSpot help. But real results for real businesses help more. Start with a family business, and document before and after.

8
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:15,710
Your final project is your first portfolio piece. Good luck!

